{"id":1766,"level":73,"name":"Поля й загроза подвійного нападу (1)","group":"Подвійний напад","format":27,"description":"<p>Besides a mating square and a promotion square, we can also attack a square on which we can set up a special attack. By simultaneously attacking an ememy piece in the process, we will see that this can this can win material.</p>  <p>Here the special attack that we focus on is the double attack. See the example.</p>  <p><strong>What do you have to do?</strong></p>  <p>Win material by attacking both a piece and a square on which a double attack can be performed.</p>","assignment":"","stickerID":66,"examples":[{"fen":"8/2n3k1/1pp3pp/8/2r1B3/6P1/2P2P1P/4R1K1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Rc4,Re7] [#]} 1. Bd3 $1 Rc3 2. Re7+ {[%csl Rc7,Rg7]} Kf6 3. Rxc7 *","text":"<p>За допомогою <strong>1.Bd3!</strong> білі атакують туру та очищають поле для тури. Дійсно, на шахівниці e7 білі можуть виконати подвійний напад: <strong>1...Rc3 2.Re7+ Kf6 3.Rxc7</strong>.</p>","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":74473,"fen":"4r1k1/2p2p1p/6p1/2R1b3/8/1PP3PP/2N3K1/8 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Rc2,Rc5,Rg2] [#]} {Q=1} 1... Bd6 ! 2. Rd5 {Q=2} Re2+ 3. Kf3 Rxc2 *","format":27,"texts":["Підготуйте форк, спочатку створивши загрозу.","Шукайте вилку."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":74482,"fen":"6k1/1p1r1p1p/3np2R/8/P7/1P6/1K4BP/8 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Rb2,Rg2,Rh6] [#]} {Q=1} 1... Nf5 ! 2. Rh3 {Q=2} Rd2+ 3. Kc3 Rxg2 *","format":27,"texts":["Підготуйте форк, спочатку створивши загрозу.","Шукайте вилку."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":74475,"fen":"8/2p2r1k/2Rb2p1/3N1nK1/7p/8/1P5P/2B5 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Rc6,Rd5,Rg5] [#]} {Q=1} 1... Nd4 ! 2. Rc3 {Q=2} Rf5+ 3. Kxh4 Rxd5 *","format":27,"texts":["Підготуйте форк, спочатку створивши загрозу.","Шукайте вилку."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":74483,"fen":"8/1k4bp/1p6/p7/8/3NP2r/1P1R1P1P/6K1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Rb7,Rg7,Rh3] [#]} {Q=1} 1. Nf4 ! Rh6 {Q=2} 2. Rd7+ Kc6 3. Rxg7 *","format":27,"texts